-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=I%27ve%20been%20killing%20you,brain%20at%20a%20time.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e10","summary":"The kraul chant as Mazirek harvests the souls of the dying guards and channels their power into his staff.","participants":["mazirek","the-kraul","sobeslav"],"location":"kraul-cavern","importance":"major","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":162,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":101,"quote":"Mazirek reached out and caught the power that resonated with each deceased soul","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=Mazirek%20reached%20out%20and,with%20each%20deceased%20soul","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=Mazirek%20reached%20out%20and,with%20each%20deceased%20soul","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e14","summary":"With the power of sixteen souls, Mazirek shoves aside the stone slab and opens a mausoleum full of hundreds of stone coffins.","participants":["mazirek","the-kraul"],"location":"umerilek","importance":"major","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":162,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":125,"quote":"He gripped either side of the stone slab and shoved it to the side.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=He%20gripped%20either%20side,it%